{"id":"theoretisch","lemma":"theoretisch","pos":"adv","rank":4043,"glosses":["theoretically"],"ipa":"/teoˈʁeːtɪʃ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/ac/De-theoretisch.ogg/De-theoretisch.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Theoretisch ist es möglich.","en":"In theory, it's possible.","words":[null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"possible"}]},{"text":"Theoretisch ist das wohl möglich.","en":"I guess theoretically it's possible.","words":[null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"possibly, probably"},{"g":"possible"}]},{"text":"Theoretisch gibt es zwischen Theorie und Praxis keinen Unterschied, sehr wohl jedoch in der Praxis.","en":"In theory, there is no difference between theory and practice. But, in practice, there is.","words":[null,{"g":"to give","l":"geben"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"between"},{"g":"theory"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"practice, experience"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},{"g":"difference"},{"g":"very"},{"g":"possibly, probably"},{"g":"but"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"practice, experience"}]}]}